{
 "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab Blog": "GPD: Distilling Routed 3D Privilege · REAL Lab 博客",
 "GPD trains an RGB-only vision-language model with a teacher that sees question-routed depth, semantic and bird's-eye-view cues. Qwen3-VL-4B: 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on four further spatial benchmarks, ahead of GRPO and answer-privileged OPSD.": "GPD 训练只看 RGB 的视觉语言模型时，给教师额外提供深度、语义和鸟瞰图线索，具体给哪几种由问题决定。以 Qwen3-VL-4B 为基座，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上得 57.1，在另外四个空间推理基准上平均 37.6，均高于 GRPO 和以答案为特权信息的 OPSD。",
 "Use the scene's true geometry as a teacher's privilege during training, and deploy an RGB-only model that has absorbed it.": "训练时把场景的真实几何交给教师，部署时模型只看 RGB，几何知识已经留在了权重里。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>October 20, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Spatial intelligence · Reinforcement learning</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>10 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 10 月 20 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>空间智能 · 强化学习</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>",
 "Vision-language models misjudge depth and direction because RGB frames carry no geometry. GPD hands the scene's true geometry to a teacher during training, only the parts each question needs, and deploys a model that still sees RGB alone.": "RGB 画面里没有几何信息，视觉语言模型因此常把深度和方向判断错。GPD 的做法是：训练时把场景的真实几何交给教师，每道题只给用得上的那部分；训练好的模型部署时仍然只看 RGB。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University · *Equal contribution †Corresponding author": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 · *同等贡献 †通讯作者",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12355\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/GPD\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>错误出在感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 怎么训练</a>",
 "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D cues as text, routed</a>": "<a href=\"#privilege\">3D 线索转文本，按问题路由</a>",
 "<a href=\"#distill\">A teacher that corrects mistakes</a>": "<a href=\"#distill\">教师只管纠错</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>哪些设计起作用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>模型学到几何了吗？</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\">Errors start in perception</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\">错误出在感知</a>",
 "<a href=\"#method\">How GPD works</a>": "<a href=\"#method\">GPD 怎么训练</a>",
 "<a href=\"#results\">Results</a>": "<a href=\"#results\">实验结果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\">What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\">哪些设计起作用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#internal\">Is the geometry absorbed?</a>": "<a href=\"#internal\">模型学到几何了吗？</a>",
 "Ask a vision-language model how far the sofa is from the door, or whether the microwave is left or right of the chair, and it often gets the geometry wrong, then reasons fluently from the wrong facts. Training with outcome rewards only tells it the final answer was wrong. Adding 3D encoders or tools fixes the input, but costs architecture changes and inference time.": "问视觉语言模型“沙发离门有多远”“微波炉在椅子左边还是右边”，它经常把几何关系弄错，再顺着错误的前提一路推下去，推理过程看上去还很通顺。只用结果奖励训练，模型只能知道最终答案错了。加 3D 编码器或调用外部工具能补上几何输入，代价是要改模型结构，推理也更慢。",
 "GPD (Geometry-Privileged Distillation) uses geometry where it is cheap: in training. Spatial datasets built from 3D scans already contain depth, object semantics and room layout. GPD turns them into short text, keeps only the cues each question needs, and gives them, with the reference answer, to a teacher that is the same model. While GRPO trains on the outcome, the teacher corrects the student's incorrect rollouts token by token. <strong>At deployment the model sees RGB frames and the question, nothing else.</strong>": "GPD（Geometry-Privileged Distillation，几何特权蒸馏）把几何信息用在成本最低的环节：训练。由 3D 扫描构建的空间数据集本来就带有深度、物体语义和房间布局。GPD 把这些信息写成简短的文本，每道题只保留用得上的线索，再连同参考答案交给教师。教师不是另一个模型，就是学生自己。GRPO 照常按结果奖励训练，教师则逐 token 修正学生答错的 rollout。<strong>部署时，模型的输入只有 RGB 帧和问题。</strong>",
 "<strong>On Qwen3-VL-4B, GPD reaches 57.1 on VSI-Bench and 37.6 on average over MindCube, SPAR-Bench, MMSI-Bench and ViewSpatial, ahead of both GRPO (56.4 and 35.7) and self-distillation with the answer as the only privilege (55.7 and 31.5).</strong>": "<strong>以 Qwen3-VL-4B 为基座，GPD 在 VSI-Bench 上得 57.1，在 MindCube、SPAR-Bench、MMSI-Bench、ViewSpatial 上平均 37.6，两项都超过 GRPO（56.4、35.7）和只以答案为特权信息的自蒸馏（55.7、31.5）。</strong>",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Best of the controlled variants</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube, SPAR, MMSI, ViewSpatial: average</p><p class=\"card-t\">+1.9 over GRPO, +6.1 over OPSD</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">Zero-shot, VSI subset, Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">Only routed text helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">Gain from adding 3D text at test time</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD needs it less</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">VSI-Bench，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">同条件对比中最高</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">MindCube、SPAR、MMSI、ViewSpatial 平均</p><p class=\"card-t\">比 GRPO 高 1.9，比 OPSD 高 6.1</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#privilege\"><p class=\"card-k\">零样本，VSI 子集，Qwen3-VL-4B</p><p class=\"card-t\">只有按问题路由的文本有帮助</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#internal\"><p class=\"card-k\">测试时补上 3D 文本的增益</p><p class=\"card-t\">GPD 更不依赖它</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Spatial errors start in perception": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>空间推理的错误出在感知",
 "Spatial reasoning asks a model to judge distance, direction and layout: plan a route, grasp the nearest object, estimate the size of a room. Two lines of work address it. <strong>Explicit 3D methods</strong> add geometric encoders or call reconstruction and perception tools at test time; they gain geometric evidence but change the architecture and slow inference. <strong>Training-based methods</strong> keep inference RGB-only and fine-tune or reinforce on spatial question answering, but their supervision is the final answer, so a wrong depth order or a flipped left–right relation along the way is never located, let alone corrected.": "空间推理要求模型判断距离、方向和布局，比如规划路线、抓取最近的物体、估算房间大小。现有方法大致分两类。<strong>显式 3D 方法</strong>在模型里加几何编码器，或者测试时调用三维重建和感知工具。几何证据有了，代价是改结构、推理变慢。<strong>训练类方法</strong>推理时只用 RGB，靠空间问答数据做微调或强化学习。可它们的监督只有最终答案：中途把深度顺序排错、把左右弄反，训练信号都定位不到，更谈不上纠正。",
 "On-policy self-distillation (OPSD) offers token-level supervision: the same model, given privileged context, re-scores the student's own trajectory. Its usual privilege is the reference answer. That cannot fix a spatial error, because the error is perceptual: <strong>a misjudged depth or direction can be corrected only by the scene's true geometry.</strong> And different questions rest on different evidence: counting on semantics, distance on depth, layout on a top-down view.": "On-policy 自蒸馏（OPSD）能给出 token 级监督：同一个模型拿到特权上下文后，给学生自己采样的轨迹重新打分。通常给的特权信息是参考答案。可空间错误出在感知上，知道答案也改不了：<strong>深度或方向看错了，只有场景的真实几何能纠正。</strong>而且不同问题依赖的证据不同，计数靠语义，距离靠深度，布局靠俯视图。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How GPD works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>GPD 怎么训练",
 "GPD has two stages. Offline, it builds question-relevant 3D cues for every training example. During training, one VLM plays two roles under two contexts. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> walks through both.": "GPD 分两步。离线阶段，为每条训练样本准备与问题相关的 3D 线索；训练阶段，同一个 VLM 换两种上下文，分别充当学生和教师。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 把这两步完整演示了一遍。",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>Route 3D cues<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">1</span>路由 3D 线索<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>Student<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">2</span>学生作答<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>Teacher<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">3</span>教师打分<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>Update<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m4-tn\">4</span>更新参数<i class=\"m4-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Route 3D cues</b><span>offline, per question</span>": "<b>路由 3D 线索</b><span>离线完成，逐题挑选</span>",
 "<b>Student</b><span>RGB frames + question only</span>": "<b>学生</b><span>只看 RGB 帧和问题</span>",
 "“Near the bed, looking at the chair: is the microwave on the chair’s left or right?”": "“站在床边看向椅子，微波炉在椅子的左边还是右边？”",
 "GRPO scores every rollout by its answer. Rollouts with reward <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 go to the teacher.": "GRPO 按答案给每个 rollout 打分，奖励 <span class=\"mi\">R</span> &lt; 0.5 的 rollout 交给教师。",
 "<b>Teacher</b><span>same weights + routed 3D cues + answer</span>": "<b>教师</b><span>同一套权重，另加路由线索和答案</span>",
 "<span>student: <b>A. Right</b></span><span>reference: <b>B. Left</b></span>": "<span>学生：<b>A. 右边</b></span><span>参考答案：<b>B. 左边</b></span>",
 "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>teacher agrees</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>teacher disagrees</span>": "<span><i class=\"hi\"></i>教师认同</span><span><i class=\"lo\"></i>教师不认同</span>",
 "<b>Update, then deploy</b><span>one set of weights</span>": "<b>更新后部署</b><span>全程只有一套权重</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub> on incorrect rollouts, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003": "<span class=\"mi\">L</span> = <span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>GRPO</sub> + <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> · min(<span class=\"mi\">L</span><sub>OPSD</sub>（只算答错的 rollout）, 1.5), <span class=\"mi\">λ</span> = 0.003",
 "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB frames</span><span class=\"m4-in\">question</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD model</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">answer</span>": "<span class=\"m4-in\">RGB 帧</span><span class=\"m4-in\">问题</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-model\">GPD 模型</span><span class=\"m4-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"m4-in ok\">答案</span>",
 "No depth, segmentation or layout at test time: the geometry lives in the weights.": "测试时不需要深度、分割或布局信息，几何已经学进了权重。",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> GPD in four steps. <b>Route:</b> the base VLM chooses which cues each question needs, following the paper's routing analysis (counting uses semantics; absolute distance uses depth; room size uses the top-down view; relative direction uses semantics and the top-down view); the privilege block is the paper's example. <b>Student:</b> the model samples a group of answers from RGB alone (rewards here are illustrative). <b>Teacher:</b> the same model, given the routed cues and the answer, re-scores an incorrect rollout token by token; the example and its shading follow the paper's Figure 3. <b>Update:</b> GRPO plus the gated distillation loss; the deployed model is RGB-only.": "<b>图 1：</b>GPD 的四个步骤。<b>路由：</b>基座 VLM 为每个问题挑选所需线索，图中的路由结果依据论文的路由分析（计数用语义，绝对距离用深度，房间面积用俯视图，相对方向用语义加俯视图）；特权信息块是论文给出的示例。<b>学生：</b>模型只看 RGB，采样一组答案（图中奖励仅为示意）。<b>教师：</b>同一个模型拿到路由线索和答案，逐 token 给一条答错的 rollout 重新打分，底色越红表示教师越不认同；示例和着色取自论文图 3。<b>更新：</b>在 GRPO 损失上加带门控的蒸馏损失，部署的模型只用 RGB。",
 "3D cues as text, routed per question": "3D 线索：写成文本，按问题路由",
 "For every training example, GPD builds up to three cues once, offline. Where a dataset comes from 3D scans, as VSI and SPAR do from ScanNet, the cues come straight from the annotations; otherwise depth is estimated with Depth Anything 3 and objects with Grounded-SAM-2. A fixed template turns each cue into a few lines of text: <strong>depth</strong> lists objects from near to far with distances, <strong>semantics</strong> lists objects with their image regions, and the <strong>bird’s-eye view</strong> gives top-down positions relative to the camera.": "每条训练样本最多配三种线索，离线构建一次即可。如果数据集本身来自 3D 扫描（VSI 和 SPAR 都取自 ScanNet），线索直接从标注里读出；否则用 Depth Anything 3 估计深度，用 Grounded-SAM-2 检测物体。每种线索都按固定模板写成几行文本：<strong>深度</strong>线索按由近到远列出物体和距离，<strong>语义</strong>线索列出物体及其在图像中的区域，<strong>鸟瞰图</strong>线索给出物体相对相机的俯视位置。",
 "Not every question needs every cue, and injecting all of them dilutes the teacher's signal. The base VLM therefore picks the relevant subset for each question, offline. The routes it picks are intuitive: counting goes entirely to semantics, absolute distance mostly to depth, room size mostly to the top-down view, and relative direction to semantics plus the top-down view.": "并不是每道题都需要全部线索，全塞给教师反而会稀释信号。所以 GPD 让基座 VLM 离线为每道题挑出相关的子集。挑选结果很符合直觉：计数题全部选语义，绝对距离大多选深度，房间面积大多选俯视图，相对方向选语义加俯视图。",
 "Text turns out to be the right form for this privilege. In a zero-shot test before any training, given to Qwen3-VL-4B without the answer, <strong>routed text is the only form of 3D input that beats RGB alone</strong> (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a>).": "实验表明，文本是承载这类特权信息最合适的形式。训练开始前，我们先做了一次零样本测试：不给答案，把不同形式的 3D 信息交给 Qwen3-VL-4B。<strong>所有 3D 输入形式里，只有路由后的文本超过了只用 RGB 的结果</strong>（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a>）。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, zero-shot, 1,000 VSI-590K questions, no reference answer": "Qwen3-VL-4B，零样本，VSI-590K 中的 1,000 道题，不提供参考答案",
 "Accuracy with different forms of 3D input (%)": "不同形式 3D 输入下的准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> The same RGB frames plus 3D cues given as rendered images or as text, either all cues or only the routed ones (paper Figure 5, left). The dashed line is RGB only; the axis starts at 40.": "<b>图 2：</b>在同样的 RGB 帧之外加入 3D 线索，线索以渲染图像或文本的形式给出，又分全部线索和只给路由线索两种情况（论文图 5 左）。虚线是只用 RGB 的准确率；横轴从 40 起。",
 "A teacher that corrects mistakes": "教师只管纠错",
 "During training, the student sees <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, question) and samples a group of eight answers; GRPO turns their rewards into advantages. The teacher is the same network given <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, question, routed cues, answer). For each token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> the student sampled, GPD compares the two log-probabilities, Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>), and uses <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 as a cheap estimate of the reverse KL.": "训练时，学生的输入是 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题)，每题采样 8 个答案，GRPO 由这组答案的奖励算出优势。教师是同一个网络，输入换成 <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span> = (RGB, 问题, 路由线索, 答案)。对学生采样出的每个 token <span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span>，GPD 比较它在两种输入下的对数概率 Δ = log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>T</sub></span>) − log π(<span class=\"mi\">t<sub>j</sub></span> | <span class=\"mi\">p<sub>S</sub></span>)，再用 <span class=\"mi\">e</span><sup>Δ</sup> − Δ − 1 低成本地估计反向 KL。",
 "Two choices keep this signal clean. <strong>It applies only to incorrect rollouts</strong> (reward below 0.5): on correct ones the teacher can only add noise. And the averaged loss is <strong>clipped at 1.5</strong>, then added to GRPO with weight λ = 0.003. The teacher thereby shapes the student's own reasoning, along its own trajectory, rather than asking it to imitate text the teacher wrote.": "为了让这个信号干净，GPD 加了两处限制。一是<strong>只作用于答错的 rollout</strong>（奖励低于 0.5），因为在答对的 rollout 上，教师只会带来噪声。二是把平均后的损失<strong>截断在 1.5</strong>，再乘以权重 λ = 0.003 加到 GRPO 损失上。这样，教师是沿着学生自己的轨迹修正它的推理，而不是让学生去模仿教师写出的文本。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Results": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>实验结果",
 "We train Qwen3-VL-Instruct at 2B and 4B for one epoch on 10K VSI, 4K SPAR and 1K MindCube questions, and compare with GRPO and with OPSD that uses the reference answer as its only privilege, all on the same data, backbone and settings.": "我们用 10K 条 VSI、4K 条 SPAR 和 1K 条 MindCube 问题，分别训练 2B 和 4B 的 Qwen3-VL-Instruct，各训练 1 个 epoch。对比方法是 GRPO 和只以参考答案为特权信息的 OPSD，三者的数据、骨干模型和训练设置完全相同。",
 "Controlled comparison, same data and backbone": "同数据、同骨干模型的对照实验",
 "VSI-Bench, average accuracy": "VSI-Bench，平均准确率",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Base model, GRPO, answer-privileged OPSD and GPD on five spatial benchmarks (paper Tables 1 and 2). “Average of four” is the mean over MindCube, SPAR, MMSI and ViewSpatial. GPD has the best average on both scales, though not on every benchmark: OPSD leads on ViewSpatial at 4B, and GRPO on SPAR at 2B.": "<b>图 3：</b>基座模型、GRPO、以答案为特权信息的 OPSD 和 GPD 在五个空间推理基准上的结果（论文表 1、表 2）。“四项平均”是 MindCube、SPAR、MMSI、ViewSpatial 的均值。两个规模下 GPD 的平均分都最高，但不是每个基准都第一：4B 时 ViewSpatial 上 OPSD 领先，2B 时 SPAR 上 GRPO 领先。",
 "<strong>On VSI-Bench</strong>, GPD-4B reaches 57.1, 1.7 points above the base model, 0.7 above GRPO and 1.4 above OPSD, with its gains on geometry-heavy subtasks such as relative distance and direction. <strong>On the four other benchmarks</strong> it averages 37.6, 1.9 points above GRPO and 6.1 above OPSD, with the largest gain on MindCube (38.0 against 33.0 for GRPO). The 2B model shows the same ordering on both averages (51.7 and 33.6). Answer-only OPSD often falls below GRPO, a reminder that an answer alone does not say where the reasoning went wrong.": "<strong>VSI-Bench 上</strong>，GPD-4B 得 57.1，比基座模型高 1.7 分，比 GRPO 高 0.7，比 OPSD 高 1.4，提升主要来自相对距离、相对方向这类依赖几何的子任务。<strong>另外四个基准上</strong>，GPD-4B 平均 37.6，比 GRPO 高 1.9，比 OPSD 高 6.1；MindCube 上提升最大，GPD 为 38.0，GRPO 为 33.0。2B 模型在两组平均分上的排序与 4B 一致（GPD 分别为 51.7 和 33.6）。只用答案的 OPSD 常常还不如 GRPO：光有答案，说明不了推理是在哪一步出错的。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>What matters": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>消融实验：哪些设计起作用",
 "We ablate on Qwen3-VL-4B, averaging over all five benchmarks. <strong>The answer and the geometry are complementary:</strong> adding the reference answer alone gives 40.2, routed 3D text alone 40.5, and both together 41.5, against 39.8 for GRPO. <strong>Routing beats more context:</strong> injecting all 3D text, with the answer, falls to 39.8, the same as GRPO, and routed cues rendered as images reach 40.4. <strong>The weight matters, and so does the gate:</strong> λ = 0.003 is best, and applying the teacher to every rollout instead of only incorrect ones costs 0.9 points.": "消融都在 Qwen3-VL-4B 上做，指标取五个基准的平均分，GRPO 为 39.8。<strong>答案和几何互补：</strong>只加参考答案得 40.2，只加路由 3D 文本得 40.5，两者都加得 41.5。<strong>按问题路由比堆上下文有效：</strong>答案加全部 3D 文本只有 39.8，与 GRPO 持平；把路由线索渲染成图像是 40.4。<strong>权重和门控都要选对：</strong>λ = 0.003 最好；教师如果作用于所有 rollout，而不只是答错的那些，平均分会少 0.9。",
 "Qwen3-VL-4B, average of five benchmarks": "Qwen3-VL-4B，五个基准平均",
 "Which privilege, in which form": "特权信息给什么、以什么形式给",
 "Same setting": "同一实验设置",
 "Distillation weight λ and scope": "蒸馏权重 λ 与作用范围",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> <b>Left:</b> privilege ablation (paper Figure 4, left). Base and OPSD are averaged from the per-benchmark tables. <b>Right:</b> the distillation weight with incorrect-only gating, against GRPO (dashed) and the all-rollouts variant at λ = 0.003 (paper Figure 4, right; values reported in the text).": "<b>图 4：</b><b>左：</b>特权信息消融（论文图 4 左），基座模型和 OPSD 的数值由各基准的表格结果求平均得到。<b>右：</b>只在答错的 rollout 上蒸馏时，不同蒸馏权重的结果；虚线为 GRPO，菱形点为 λ = 0.003 时作用于全部 rollout 的变体（论文图 4 右，数值取自正文）。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Is the geometry absorbed?": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>模型学到几何了吗？",
 "If GPD internalizes the cues, giving them back at test time should help it less. That is what happens (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>): with RGB alone, GPD scores 56.3 against 54.9 for GRPO; adding routed 3D text at test time lifts GRPO by 2.1 points but GPD by only 0.6.": "如果 GPD 真的把这些线索学进去了，测试时再把线索提供给它，收益应该更小。结果确实如此（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>）：只用 RGB 时，GPD 得 56.3，GRPO 得 54.9；测试时补上路由 3D 文本，GRPO 涨了 2.1 分，GPD 只涨 0.6 分。",
 "Accuracy with RGB only, and with routed 3D text added at test time": "只用 RGB 与测试时补上路由 3D 文本的准确率",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Test-time dependence on 3D privilege (paper Figure 7; the axis starts at 50). The smaller gap for GPD suggests the geometric cues were absorbed during training.": "<b>图 5：</b>测试时对 3D 特权信息的依赖程度（论文图 7；纵轴从 50 起）。GPD 两根柱子的差距更小，说明它在训练中已经吸收了几何线索。",
 "The training curves agree. Validation accuracy is similar early on, then GPD keeps improving while GRPO plateaus; GPD's policy entropy peaks higher and earlier, a sign that the teacher's signal broadens exploration before the two settle. In the paper's case study, a four-view question about walking toward a stone fountain, GPD localizes the camera, maps the turn into the scene's frame and finds the fountain across views, while GRPO places the fountain on the wrong side of a jar and answers wrongly.": "训练曲线给出了同样的结论。验证准确率前期相差不大，之后 GRPO 进入平台期，GPD 还在继续上升。GPD 的策略熵峰值更高、出现更早，说明在两者稳定下来之前，教师信号拓宽了探索。论文的案例分析里有一道四视角题，问的是朝一座石头喷泉走过去的情形。GPD 先定位相机，把转向换算到场景坐标系，再跨视角找到喷泉；GRPO 则把喷泉定在了罐子错误的一侧，最后答错。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path leaves a torn paper cube, bends at a node and reaches a flat sheet, on which a faint outline of the cube appears": "动画：一道墨线从撕开的纸立方体出发，在一个节点处转折，落到一张平铺的纸上，纸面随之浮现出立方体的淡淡轮廓",
 "Backbone": "骨干模型",
 "Benchmark": "评测基准"
}